{"k":{"t01-apar-0":"<span class=\"ln\" data-korpo=\"12.6pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">說明手冊</span> <span class=\"ln\" data-korpo=\"8.4pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">附於</span> <span class=\"ln lg\" data-korpo=\"15.6pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">德爾馬斯輔助掛圖</span> <span class=\"orn\">❦</span> <span class=\"ln\" data-korpo=\"13.2pt\" data-rolo=\"serio\">第一組</span> <span class=\"fil\"></span>","t01-apar-1":"<span class=\"ln lg\" data-korpo=\"15.0pt\" data-rolo=\"nom\">圖表第 1 號</span> <span class=\"ln lg\" data-korpo=\"11.4pt\" data-rolo=\"tit\">學校。— 中學。— 課室。</span> <span class=\"fil\"></span>","t01-tit-1":"<span class=\"pk\" data-korpo=\"10.2pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">總體描述。</span>","t01-01-1":"1. — 呢張圖表畫嘅係一間<b>中學</b>嘅<b>課室</b>。呢間課室入面有八張<b>檯</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.339325,0.560105,0.009987,0.010154\" data-n=\"18\" title=\"tabli\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(18)</sup></button> 同八張<b>長凳</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.298491,0.886341,0.009543,0.012447\" data-n=\"32\" title=\"benki\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(32)</sup></button>。每張長凳坐三個學生。<b>老師</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.104527,0.503767,0.004882,0.010481\" data-n=\"7\" title=\"docisto\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(7)</sup></button> 坐喺<b>椅</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.072792,0.542745,0.00466,0.012119\" data-n=\"8\" title=\"stulo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(8)</sup></button> 上面，喺自己嘅<b>講檯</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.134043,0.602358,0.00466,0.011137\" data-n=\"6\" title=\"katedro\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(6)</sup></button> 度。","t01-02-1":"2. — 講檯左邊有個<b>玻璃門櫃</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.188859,0.618736,0.008877,0.010481\" data-n=\"15\" title=\"armoro\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(15)</sup></button>。右邊係<b>黑板</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.016644,0.59679,0.003329,0.010481\" data-n=\"1\" title=\"nigra tabelo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(1)</sup></button>，仲有<b>黑板擦</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.034842,0.685228,0.005548,0.010154\" data-n=\"2\" title=\"vishilo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(2)</sup></button> 同<b>粉筆</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.055704,0.744186,0.004882,0.010481\" data-n=\"3\" title=\"kreto\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(3)</sup></button>。","t01-02-2":"講檯上面掛住幾幅<b>掛圖</b> <sup>(<button class=\"lupo nuda\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.042166,0.4887,0.00466,0.010481\" data-n=\"9\" title=\"mural tabeli\" aria-expanded=\"false\">9</button>, <button class=\"lupo nuda\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.097426,0.279725,0.007767,0.010481\" data-n=\"11\" title=\"mural tabeli\" aria-expanded=\"false\">11</button>, <button class=\"lupo nuda\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.170883,0.311824,0.009099,0.010481\" data-n=\"12\" title=\"mural tabeli\" aria-expanded=\"false\">12</button>)</sup> 同一幅<b>地圖</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.117843,0.250901,0.009099,0.010481\" data-n=\"10\" title=\"mapo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(10)</sup></button>。","t01-03-1":"3. — 唔係個個學生都坐喺自己嘅<b>位</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.290945,0.528005,0.011096,0.010809\" data-n=\"17\" title=\"plaso\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(17)</sup></button> 度。約翰 <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.006658,0.712414,0.00577,0.010481\" data-n=\"4\" title=\"\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(4)</sup></button> 企喺黑板旁邊；佢攞住黑板擦，抹緊啲<b>幾何圖形</b>。","t01-03-2":"彼得喺講檯附近；佢收緊啲<b>功課</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.092543,0.64756,0.005104,0.010809\" data-n=\"5\" title=\"skribo-taski\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(5)</sup></button>，攞去畀老師。","t01-04-1":"4. — <b>呢位</b>老師係教<b>現代語</b>嘅。佢教啲學生講、讀同寫外國話<b>（德文、英文、西班牙文、意大利文、俄文</b>或者<b>法文）</b>。","t01-05-1":"5. — 課室好大好光。入面盡頭有一扇闊嘅<b>窗</b>，上面有兩個<b>氣窗</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.336662,0.236489,0.010209,0.010481\" data-n=\"78\" title=\"postigi\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(78)</sup></button>，仲有一道<b>玻璃門</b>，用嚟通風同採光。","t01-05-2":"呢間課室唔凍。中間有個好好嘅<b>火爐</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.543054,0.73567,0.011984,0.010809\" data-n=\"46\" title=\"furnelo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(46)</sup></button> 同佢嘅<b>煙通</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.506214,0.622666,0.010431,0.011464\" data-n=\"45\" title=\"tubo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(45)</sup></button> 用嚟取暖。","t01-05-3":"牆上釘住幾個<b>衣鈎</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.908566,0.720275,0.009543,0.011464\" data-n=\"58\" title=\"vest-hoki\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(58)</sup></button>；學生嘅帽同大褸就掛喺嗰度。","t01-tit-2":"<span class=\"pk\" data-korpo=\"10.2pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">操場。</span>","t01-06-1":"6. — <b>鐘</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.781846,0.21225,0.010874,0.010481\" data-n=\"63\" title=\"horlojo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(63)</sup></button> 指住九點零五分。","t01-06-2":"<b>小息</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.38016,0.384212,0.010874,0.010481\" data-n=\"76\" title=\"amuz-tempo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(76)</sup></button> 啱啱完，堂又開始返。小息係喺<b>操場</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.36285,0.442516,0.008655,0.010154\" data-n=\"75\" title=\"korto\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(75)</sup></button> 度玩嘅。我哋見到有幾個學生喺度玩。一位<b>訓導</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.419441,0.372093,0.011318,0.010481\" data-n=\"74\" title=\"Submaestro\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(74)</sup></button> 睇住佢哋。","t01-07-1":"7. — 喺操場度我哋仲見到第啲人：<b>督學</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.400355,0.432689,0.010652,0.010481\" data-n=\"73\" title=\"inspektisto\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(73)</sup></button>、<b>校長</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.47692,0.431379,0.008655,0.010809\" data-n=\"71\" title=\"(liceestro)\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(71)</sup></button> 同<b>教務主任</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.441411,0.428431,0.010652,0.010481\" data-n=\"72\" title=\"censoro\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(72)</sup></button>。","t01-07-2":"督學視察啲學校，校長管住間中學，教務主任就睇住啲功課。","t01-07-3":"第四個人係<b>看更</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.33644,0.429414,0.010652,0.010481\" data-n=\"77\" title=\"pordisto\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(77)</sup></button>。佢挾住本簿，用嚟記低邊個缺席。","t01-08-1":"8. — 操場盡頭有<b>體操器械</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.467599,0.393384,0.009543,0.009826\" data-n=\"70\" title=\"gimnastikal aparati\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(70)</sup></button> 同做<b>手工</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.559698,0.471995,0.010874,0.010481\" data-n=\"69\" title=\"manulabori\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(69)</sup></button> 嘅工場。","t01-08-2":"圖表右邊我哋開始見到<b>音樂</b>同<b>美術</b>嘅<b>課室</b>。","t01-tit-3":"<span class=\"pk\" data-korpo=\"10.2pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">詳細描述。</span>","t01-tit-4":"<span class=\"pk\" data-korpo=\"10.2pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">好學生。</span>","t01-09-1":"9. — 講檯右邊第一張長凳嘅學生係<b>亨利</b><button class=\"apel\" data-noto=\"yue-t01-noto-1\" aria-expanded=\"false\">(*)</button>、<b>司提反</b>同<b>查理</b>。","t01-09-2":"亨利好專心好勤力；佢聽住老師講。佢張檯上面有一本<b>簿</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.230581,0.868981,0.010209,0.011464\" data-n=\"28\" title=\"kayero\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(28)</sup></button>、一本<b>書</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.199068,0.863085,0.010209,0.010481\" data-n=\"29\" title=\"libro\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(29)</sup></button>、一本<b>字典</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.159565,0.891582,0.010874,0.011137\" data-n=\"30\" title=\"lexiko\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(30)</sup></button> 同一個<b>筆盒</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.214603,0.905011,0.009543,0.011137\" data-n=\"31\" title=\"skribiluyo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(31)</sup></button>。佢本書有好多<b>頁</b>；每一章有幾個<b>段落</b>，每一<b>行</b>有好多<b>字</b>。","t01-09-4":"佢隔籬嘅司提反 <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.291389,0.81035,0.012206,0.010154\" data-n=\"24\" title=\"\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(24)</sup></button> 好用功。佢喺簿上面抄低下堂要用嘅嘢。佢寫得一手好<b>字</b>。佢本書閂咗，我哋淨係見到個<b>書皮</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.201287,0.804455,0.010431,0.010809\" data-n=\"27\" title=\"kovrilo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(27)</sup></button>。佢個<b>圓規</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.21771,0.820832,0.010874,0.010809\" data-n=\"26\" title=\"kompaso\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(26)</sup></button> 就喺佢隔籬。","t01-09-5":"查理 <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.270084,0.730102,0.009987,0.011137\" data-n=\"23\" title=\"\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(23)</sup></button> 攞住本書；佢揭開嚟溫書。同每個學生一樣，佢面前有個<b>墨水樽</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.241456,0.717982,0.011318,0.009826\" data-n=\"25\" title=\"inkuyo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(25)</sup></button>。佢好聽話。","t01-10-1":"10. — 隔籬張檯坐住<b>路易</b>、<b>安東</b>同<b>保羅</b>。路易背緊佢嘅<b>書</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.365291,0.645922,0.010652,0.010481\" data-n=\"22\" title=\"leciono\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(22)</sup></button>，又答老師嘅<b>問題</b>。安東 <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.329117,0.630855,0.009099,0.010481\" data-n=\"21\" title=\"\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(21)</sup></button> 好唔專心，老師有時仲要罰佢添。保羅 <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.334665,0.600721,0.010874,0.010809\" data-n=\"20\" title=\"\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(20)</sup></button> 係個好同學，又和氣又肯幫人。佢好專心。","t01-tit-5":"<span class=\"pk\" data-korpo=\"10.2pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">壞學生。</span>","t01-11-1":"11. — 亨利後面坐住<b>佐治</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.543276,0.87455,0.010209,0.010481\" data-n=\"38\" title=\"Georgius\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(38)</sup></button>。佢唔算係曳仔，不過佢<b>多口</b>、唔專心、坐唔定。佢嘅<b>輕浮</b>同<b>唔聽話</b>喺堂上搞出<b>混亂</b>，所以佢成日要俾人<b>嚴厲警告</b>。佢本<b>草稿簿</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.486906,0.885686,0.009987,0.010809\" data-n=\"35\" title=\"klado-kayero\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(35)</sup></button> 好污糟，佢用支<b>筆嘴</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.513316,0.936456,0.011762,0.008516\" data-n=\"34\" title=\"plumo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(34)</sup></button> 喺上面<b>搞到成篇墨漬</b>，所以佢成日要用<b>擦膠</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.478695,0.859155,0.010874,0.011137\" data-n=\"36\" title=\"efacokauchuko\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(36)</sup></button>；佢個<b>書袋</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.454949,0.912217,0.010431,0.012119\" data-n=\"33\" title=\"kayeruyo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(33)</sup></button> 爛咗，因為佢好大意。點解佢會攞住個<b>筆筒</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.496671,0.864723,0.009987,0.010481\" data-n=\"37\" title=\"krayoniero\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(37)</sup></button> 入現代語堂呢？","t01-11-2":"佢隔籬嘅愛德蒙 <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.53573,0.800852,0.010209,0.010481\" data-n=\"39\" title=\"\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(39)</sup></button> 唔中意佢。呢個雖然的確有啲懶，但係佢靜靜哋唔搞事。佢唔多口；不過佢唔聽書，寧願睇自己本<b>讀本</b>入面嘅<b>故事</b>。","t01-11-3":"呢張長凳第三個學生係<b>路多維</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.483577,0.767114,0.011096,0.010809\" data-n=\"40\" title=\"Ludovikus\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(40)</sup></button>。佢好勤力。佢喺一張白<b>紙</b>上面寫嘢。佢面前擺住張<b>吸墨紙</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.432091,0.739928,0.009099,0.010481\" data-n=\"41\" title=\"absorbiva papero\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(41)</sup></button>。","t01-12-1":"12. — 老師左邊第二張長凳嘅學生仲細個。第一個係細細個嘅<b>愛美</b>，佢仲未識寫得好；佢帶住自己嘅<b>石板</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.45162,0.655421,0.011318,0.010481\" data-n=\"42\" title=\"ardezo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(42)</sup></button>、<b>石筆</b>同<b>海綿</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.437195,0.627252,0.011096,0.010809\" data-n=\"43\" title=\"sponjo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(43)</sup></button>。","t01-12-2":"佢隔籬係<b>奧古</b>同<b>伯納</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.437195,0.591549,0.011984,0.009499\" data-n=\"44\" title=\"Bernardus\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(44)</sup></button>。後者讀書幾好，不過佢嘅<b>衣著</b>好邋遢。","t01-13-1":"13. — 佢哋後面坐住三個<b>懶蟲。亞爾拔</b>唔溫書。<b>雅各</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.629161,0.611857,0.010874,0.010809\" data-n=\"47\" title=\"Iakobus\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(47)</sup></button> 唔聽書，喺度瞓覺。佢嘅<b>懶惰</b>為佢招嚟<b>責備</b>甚至<b>懲罰</b>。最後，<b>基士頓</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.679982,0.61153,0.009987,0.010154\" data-n=\"48\" title=\"Kristianus\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(48)</sup></button> 太過輕浮。佢<b>品行</b>唔好，又完全唔肯改。","t01-14-1":"14. — 相反，坐喺佢隔籬嘅同學品行好好。<b>恩尼斯</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.699956,0.702588,0.007989,0.010809\" data-n=\"51\" title=\"Ernestus\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(51)</sup></button> 中意<b>整齊</b>同<b>有規矩</b>；佢成日用自己支<b>間尺</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.692632,0.793318,0.008877,0.010809\" data-n=\"50\" title=\"linealo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(50)</sup></button> 同支<b>鉛筆</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.671993,0.744841,0.010209,0.009171\" data-n=\"49\" title=\"krayono\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(49)</sup></button>。佢係<b>走讀生</b>。","t01-14-2":"<b>方濟</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.780293,0.754012,0.009543,0.011137\" data-n=\"52\" title=\"Franciskus\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(52)</sup></button> 係<b>寄宿生</b>；佢著校服，喺學校食飯瞓覺。佢係個好<b>同學</b>。","t01-14-3":"毛里斯用自己把<b>小刀</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.786951,0.886341,0.010431,0.010481\" data-n=\"56\" title=\"kulteleto\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(56)</sup></button> 削<b>鉛筆</b>；佢好細心。","t01-14-4":"佢帶齊自己所有書，佢本<b>文法</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.732801,0.892892,0.009543,0.010481\" data-n=\"55\" title=\"gramatiko\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(55)</sup></button>、佢本<b>記事簿</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.709055,0.857845,0.011096,0.010481\" data-n=\"54\" title=\"notlibreto\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(54)</sup></button>，仲有塊<b>墊寫板</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.762761,0.880118,0.010209,0.010481\" data-n=\"53\" title=\"skribkuseno\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(53)</sup></button>。佢個<b>書包</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.930537,0.91451,0.010209,0.010809\" data-n=\"57\" title=\"skolsako\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(57)</sup></button> 就喺佢後面地下。","t01-14-5":"課室盡頭嗰兩張檯係<b>好學生</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.337772,0.507042,0.008433,0.010809\" data-n=\"19\" title=\"bona lernanti\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(19)</sup></button> 嘅位。","t01-tit-6":"<span class=\"pk\" data-korpo=\"10.2pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">美術同音樂。</span>","t01-15-1":"15. — <b>美術室</b>入面有幾個靚<b>模型</b>掛喺牆上，仲有一盞有<b>燈罩</b>嘅<b>燈</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.975144,0.45922,0.009765,0.010809\" data-n=\"62\" title=\"lampo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(62)</sup></button> 吊喺天花。<b>老師</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.81447,0.575827,0.009543,0.011464\" data-n=\"60\" title=\"docisto\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(60)</sup></button> 好有耐性；佢改學生嘅<b>畫</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.891034,0.610219,0.007324,0.009826\" data-n=\"61\" title=\"desegnuri\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(61)</sup></button>，又教佢哋照真人畫<b>半身像</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.976476,0.514248,0.009987,0.010481\" data-n=\"59\" title=\"busto\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(59)</sup></button>。","t01-16-1":"16. — <b>音樂室</b>好似好有趣。喺嗰度人哋學讀<b>樂譜</b>，唱寫喺<b>五線譜</b>上面嘅<b>音階音</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.753884,0.423845,0.011096,0.010481\" data-n=\"67\" title=\"gamnoti\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(67)</sup></button>（do、re、mi、fa、sol、 la、si = C. D. E. F. G. A. B.），學識啲<b>譜號</b>，又唱好聽嘅<b>曲調</b>。啲樂譜擺喺<b>譜架</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.640257,0.466099,0.010431,0.010481\" data-n=\"65\" title=\"pupitro\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(65)</sup></button> 上面。一個學生<b>彈鋼琴</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.758766,0.510645,0.010652,0.010809\" data-n=\"64\" title=\"pianopleas\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(64)</sup></button>，<b>音樂老師</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.699512,0.461513,0.009099,0.010809\" data-n=\"66\" title=\"muzik-docisto\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(66)</sup></button> 就<b>打拍子</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.725477,0.447101,0.010431,0.010481\" data-n=\"68\" title=\"skandas\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(68)</sup></button>。","t01-17-1":"17. — 我哋開始見到做<b>手工</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.559698,0.471995,0.010874,0.010481\" data-n=\"69\" title=\"manulabori\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(69)</sup></button> 嘅<b>工場</b>一角，喺嗰度啲男仔可以學刨木同銼鐵。唔係間間中學都有呢啲。","t01-tit-7":"<span class=\"pk\" data-korpo=\"10.2pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">科學室。</span>","t01-18-1":"18. — 數學老師教學生<b>幾何</b>、<b>算術</b>、<b>計算</b>同<b>米制</b>。我哋喺黑板上面見到幾何嘅主要圖形：<b>圓</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.019633,0.658661,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"a\" title=\"rondo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(a)</sup></button>、<b>正方形</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.052468,0.626557,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"b\" title=\"quadrato\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(b)</sup></button>、<b>三角形</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.049811,0.67077,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"c\" title=\"triangulo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(c)</sup></button>、<b>線</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.035173,0.739874,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"d\" title=\"lineo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(d)</sup></button>。","t01-18-2":"我哋仲見到一條<b>運算</b>；佢唔係<b>加法</b>，唔係<b>減法</b>，亦都唔係<b>乘法</b>：佢正正係<b>除法</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.065565,0.676005,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"e\" title=\"divido\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(e)</sup></button>。","t01-19-1":"19. — 喺米制嗰幅掛圖上面，我哋見到：<b>米</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.052217,0.380286,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"a\" title=\"metro\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(a)</sup></button>、<b>天秤</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.015161,0.379639,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"b\" title=\"balanco\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(b)</sup></button> 同佢啲<b>砝碼</b>、<b>公升</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.059978,0.343932,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"e\" title=\"ponderili, litro\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(e)</sup></button>、<b>十升</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.013372,0.258796,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"f\" title=\"dekalitro\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(f)</sup></button>、<b>分升</b>同<b>立方米</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.03224,0.324944,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"d\" title=\"metral kubo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(d)</sup></button>。","t01-19-2":"學生仲學<b>自然科學</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.097426,0.279725,0.007767,0.010481\" data-n=\"11\" title=\"mural tabeli\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(11)</sup></button> — 動物學 <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.124098,0.290533,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"a\" title=\"zoologio\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(a)</sup></button>、植物學 <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.132317,0.3652,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"b\" title=\"botaniko\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(b)</sup></button>、地質學 <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.127443,0.431354,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"c\" title=\"geologio\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(c)</sup></button> — 同<b>歷史</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.170883,0.311824,0.009099,0.010481\" data-n=\"12\" title=\"mural tabeli\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(12)</sup></button>。","t01-19-3":"櫃入面擺住<b>物理</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.188859,0.618736,0.008877,0.010481\" data-n=\"15\" title=\"armoro\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(15)</sup></button> 同<b>化學</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.230138,0.5755,0.009321,0.010481\" data-n=\"16\" title=\"kemio\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(16)</sup></button> 嘅儀器。","t01-19-4":"櫃頂擺住：一個<b>球體</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.189525,0.419915,0.009987,0.010481\" data-n=\"14\" title=\"sfero\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(14)</sup></button>、一個<b>圓錐</b>同一個<b>地球儀</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.175322,0.387815,0.010209,0.011464\" data-n=\"13\" title=\"terglobo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(13)</sup></button>。","t01-19-5":"啲掛圖上面掛住一幅<b>地圖</b>，畫住世界五大洲：<b>歐洲</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.161802,0.143808,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"e\" title=\"Europa\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(e)</sup></button>、<b>亞洲</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.20951,0.166394,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"g\" title=\"Azia\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(g)</sup></button>、<b>非洲</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.155821,0.230267,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"f\" title=\"Afrika\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(f)</sup></button>、<b>美洲</b> <sup>(<button class=\"lupo nuda\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.073486,0.101258,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"a\" title=\"Amerika\" aria-expanded=\"false\">a</button><button class=\"lupo nuda\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.084585,0.148741,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"b\" title=\"Amerika\" aria-expanded=\"false\">b</button>)</sup> 同<b>大洋洲</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.209077,0.256781,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"h\" title=\"Oceania\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(h)</sup></button>，仲有兩個大洋，<b>太平洋</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.036213,0.146461,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"c\" title=\"Pacifiko\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(c)</sup></button> 同<b>大西洋</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.116538,0.161832,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"d\" title=\"Atlantiko\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(d)</sup></button>。 <span class=\"fil\"></span>","t02-apar-1":"<span class=\"ln lg\" data-korpo=\"15.0pt\" data-rolo=\"nom\">圖表第 2 號</span> <span class=\"ln lg\" data-korpo=\"11.4pt\" data-rolo=\"tit\" data-kunligita=\"1\">人體。— 小息。</span> <span class=\"ln lg\" data-korpo=\"11.4pt\" data-rolo=\"tit\" data-kunligita=\"1\"> 啲遊戲。</span><span class=\"fil\"></span>","t02-tit-0":"<span class=\"ln lg\" data-korpo=\"13.2pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">人體。</span> <span class=\"ln\" data-korpo=\"10.2pt\" data-rolo=\"subt\"><i>（自然科學嘅簡單一課。）</i></span>","t02-01-1":"1. — 人體嘅主要部分係：<b>頭</b>、<b>身</b>同<b>四肢</b>。","t02-tit-1":"<span class=\"pk\" data-korpo=\"10.2pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">個頭。</span>","t02-02-1":"2. — 頭分兩部分：<b>頭骨</b>，入面裝住<b>腦</b>，外面畀<b>頭髮</b>蓋住；仲有<b>塊面</b>。","t02-03-1":"3. — 喺我哋幅圖上面，頭骨同腦都睇唔到；不過塊面重要嘅部分就睇得好清楚。","t02-04-1":"4. — 首先係<b>額頭</b>，佢顯出強大嘅才智同不斷運轉嘅思想。<b>太陽穴</b>好開闊。<b>隻眼</b>靈活，張得好大。濃密嘅<b>眉毛</b>同長長嘅<b>眼睫毛</b>護住佢。","t02-05-1":"5. — 跟住係<b>個鼻</b>同<b>鼻孔</b>。個鼻幫我哋聞嘢同呼吸。鼻嘅兩邊係<b>面珠</b>，再遠啲就係<b>對耳</b>。塊面下半部係<b>把口</b>同<b>下巴</b>。","t02-06-1":"6. — 我哋睇得唔算好清楚，因為<b>上唇鬚</b>同<b>腮鬚</b>遮住咗佢哋。不過我哋知道把口有兩片<b>嘴唇</b>、<b>上顎</b>同<b>下顎</b>連埋佢哋嘅<b>牙</b>，仲有條<b>脷</b>。我哋用把口講嘢同食嘢。我哋用條脷嚟試味。","t02-07-1":"7. — 眼、耳、鼻同口，同啲手指一樣，都係五官嘅器官：<b>視覺</b>、<b>聽覺</b>、<b>嗅覺</b>、<b>味覺</b>、<b>觸覺</b>。","t02-08-1":"8. — 所以個頭係人體最有趣嘅部分之一。","t02-tit-2":"<span class=\"pk\" data-korpo=\"10.2pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">個身。</span>","t02-09-1":"9. — <b>條頸</b>接住個頭同個身。佢包括<b>喉嚨</b>同<b>頸背</b>。","t02-10-1":"10. — 個身入面仲有好多重要嘅器官。<b>胸腔</b>入面有<b>肺</b>，我哋靠佢呼吸；仲有<b>個心</b>，佢係生命嘅中心。個心一停，生物就死。","t02-11-1":"11. — <b>肋骨</b>托住個胸腔。","t02-12-1":"12. — 個身其餘嘅部分係<b>腰</b>、<b>個背</b>、<b>膊頭</b>同<b>個肚</b>。我哋瞓覺嗰陣側住或者仰住瞓；我哋用膊頭孭嘢。","t02-13-1":"13. — 個肚入面有<b>個胃</b>同<b>啲腸</b>。佢哋幫我哋消化食物。","t02-tit-3":"<span class=\"pk\" data-korpo=\"10.2pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">四肢。</span>","t02-14-1":"14. — 我哋有四條<b>肢</b>：兩隻<b>手臂</b>同兩隻<b>腳</b>。我哋用手臂攞嘢、揸嘢、抬嘢、執嘢；用腳企、行同跑。","t02-15-1":"15. — <b>膊頭</b>接住手臂同個身。一嚿好強壯嘅<b>肌肉</b>，二頭肌，令手臂郁到；<b>手踭</b>就接住手臂同<b>前臂</b>。<b>手腕</b>組成<b>隻手</b>嘅關節，隻手末端係<b>手指</b>同<b>指甲</b>。喺隻手上面，我哋分得出<b>靜脈</b>（同動脈），<b>血</b>就喺入面流。","t02-16-1":"16. — 隻腳嘅部分係：<b>大髀</b>、<b>膝頭哥</b>同<b>膝彎</b>、<b>小腿肚</b>—— 佢嘅<b>肉</b>畀<b>皮</b>包住—— <b>腳眼</b>同<b>腳板</b>。腳嘅<b>骨</b>好粗好硬。腳前面係<b>腳趾</b>。其餘嘅部分係<b>腳底</b>同<b>腳踭</b>。","t02-17-1":"17. — 呢個就係人體差唔多完整嘅描述。","t02-17-2":"<i>註。</i> — <i>用「我……（個頭等等）痛」呢句講法，老師可以喺</i><b>身體狀況</b><i>好定唔好呢個角度，將呢一整套詞語再用一次。</i>","t02-tit-4":"<span class=\"pk\" data-korpo=\"10.2pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">體操。</span> <span class=\"ln\" data-korpo=\"10.2pt\" data-rolo=\"subt\"><i>（一位學生講嘅故事。）</i></span>","t02-18-1":"18. — 為咗身體柔軟、靈活同健康，我哋要練我哋嘅腳同手臂。所以我哋玩嘢，又做<b>體操</b>。","t02-19-1":"19. — 平日呢兩樣都喺中學嘅操場度做（睇圖表第 1 號）。不過星期四同星期日，我哋會去一塊大草地，喺嗰度有位跑同玩。","t02-20-1":"20. — 我哋啲老師同父母有時同我哋一齊去；不過帶操嘅係<b>體育老師</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t02-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.160097,0.605298,0.0093,0.010596\" data-n=\"12\" title=\"docisto pri gimnastiko\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(12)</sup></button>。","t02-21-1":"21. — 草地上面，入口左邊有<b>體操器械</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t02-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.096988,0.335099,0.003543,0.010596\" data-n=\"1\" title=\"gimnastikal aparati\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(1)</sup></button>；我哋爬<b>梯</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t02-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.005757,0.427483,0.004872,0.010596\" data-n=\"2\" title=\"skalo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(2)</sup></button>，喺<b>吊環</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t02-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.054473,0.482781,0.004872,0.010596\" data-n=\"3\" title=\"ringi\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(3)</sup></button> 同<b>吊槓</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t02-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.081488,0.459603,0.005536,0.010927\" data-n=\"4\" title=\"trapezo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(4)</sup></button> 上面翻筋斗，又用手攀上<b>繩梯</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t02-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.111825,0.438742,0.004429,0.010596\" data-n=\"5\" title=\"korda skalo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(5)</sup></button> 或者<b>打結繩</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t02-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.129097,0.449669,0.005093,0.010596\" data-n=\"6\" title=\"kordo nodoza\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(6)</sup></button> 嘅頂。","t02-22-1":"22. — 同時，我哋啲同學跳過<b>木馬</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t02-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.18357,0.56755,0.004872,0.010265\" data-n=\"7\" title=\"ligna kavalo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(7)</sup></button> 或者<b>雙槓</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t02-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.093446,0.66755,0.007529,0.009603\" data-n=\"11\" title=\"stangi paralela\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(11)</sup></button>。第啲人就<b>打拳</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t02-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.10961,0.57053,0.005093,0.011921\" data-n=\"8\" title=\"boxas\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(8)</sup></button> 或者<b>劍擊</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t02-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.036094,0.607285,0.004429,0.011258\" data-n=\"9\" title=\"skermas\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(9)</sup></button>，戴住面罩，攞住<b>花劍</b>。最後仲有人<b>舉啞鈴</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t02-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.046944,0.684437,0.007972,0.010596\" data-n=\"10\" title=\"halteragas\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(10)</sup></button>。","t02-tit-5":"<span class=\"pk\" data-korpo=\"10.2pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">啲遊戲。</span>","t02-23-1":"23. — 喺做體操嗰班人周圍，男仔女仔玩緊唔同嘅<b>遊戲</b>。啲女仔玩<b>鐵環</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t02-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.197963,0.710596,0.008415,0.009934\" data-n=\"14\" title=\"ringego\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(14)</sup></button>；佢哋<b>跳繩</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t02-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.141275,0.663245,0.009079,0.010596\" data-n=\"13\" title=\"kordo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(13)</sup></button>，或者叫自己嘅細佬同表兄弟一齊玩一局<b>槌球</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t02-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.106953,0.823179,0.008857,0.010596\" data-n=\"15\" title=\"kroket\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(15)</sup></button>。佢哋最開心就係喺對手以為好易穿過拱門嗰陣，用自己嘅<b>木槌</b>撞開佢個<b>波</b>！","t02-24-1":"24. — 啲男仔中意用力嘅遊戲。佢哋鍾意打<b>木瓶</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t02-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.31643,0.743377,0.0093,0.011589\" data-n=\"16\" title=\"kegli\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(16)</sup></button>，用一個<b>波</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t02-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.473649,0.727815,0.0093,0.010596\" data-n=\"17\" title=\"bulo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(17)</sup></button> 好準咁撞冧佢哋。佢哋亦都唔嫌棄<b>陀螺</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t02-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.520593,0.906291,0.008193,0.012252\" data-n=\"18\" title=\"tupio\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(18)</sup></button> 同<b>杯球</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t02-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.532551,0.77947,0.008857,0.010596\" data-n=\"19\" title=\"bilboketo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(19)</sup></button>，甚至<b>青蛙戲</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t02-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.58326,0.919868,0.010629,0.010596\" data-n=\"20\" title=\"ranoludo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(20)</sup></button>。不過佢哋最中意嘅仲係<b>波子</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t02-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.859389,0.934106,0.009079,0.010596\" data-n=\"21\" title=\"buleti\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(21)</sup></button> 同<b>撞牆波</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t02-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.890168,0.615232,0.011072,0.010265\" data-n=\"22\" title=\"mur-baloneto\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(22)</sup></button>，因為<b>溫室</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t02-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.861825,0.515563,0.01085,0.010596\" data-n=\"26\" title=\"teplico\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(26)</sup></button> 嗰幅牆好啱畀輕波彈返轉頭。","t02-25-1":"25. — 細個嘅約翰踩住<b>高蹺</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t02-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.796723,0.799338,0.011293,0.010596\" data-n=\"24\" title=\"stelti\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(24)</sup></button>，好靈活，平衡好得好好。喺佢附近，幾個同學喺溫室入面同<b>籬笆</b>後面玩<b>捉迷藏</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t02-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.698184,0.771854,0.010186,0.010927\" data-n=\"25\" title=\"celo-trovo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(25)</sup></button>。第啲人就中意<b>打手掌</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t02-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.582595,0.689073,0.010186,0.010927\" data-n=\"28\" title=\"frap-divino\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(28)</sup></button>，或者玩<b>羽毛球</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t02-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.660097,0.558278,0.010629,0.011589\" data-n=\"29\" title=\"flugbalono\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(29)</sup></button>，個球喺一支<b>球拍</b>同另一支之間飛來飛去。","t02-26-1":"26. — 草地中間有兩棵樹。喺其中一棵樹腳下，七八個男仔組織咗一局<b>跳膊頭</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t02-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.59876,0.598344,0.009743,0.012583\" data-n=\"30\" title=\"shultro-salto\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(30)</sup></button> <button class=\"apel\" data-noto=\"yue-t02-noto-1\" aria-expanded=\"false\">(*)</button>。呢個遊戲唔係個個國家都識；不過個個都知<b>跳山羊</b>係乜，雖然今次啲細路唔係玩緊呢個。","t02-tit-6":"<span class=\"pk\" data-korpo=\"10.2pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">露天嘅遊戲。</span>","t02-27-1":"27. <b>蒙眼捉人</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t02-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.313552,0.566887,0.008193,0.010596\" data-n=\"31\" title=\"blindo-ludo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(31)</sup></button> 都好好玩；女仔同男仔輪流將<b>眼罩</b>戴上眼，去捉嗰啲唔夠醒目、畀人捉到嘅人。","t02-28-1":"28. — 草地中間，呢個係好法國、不過有啲粗野嘅遊戲：叫做<b>熊仔戲</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t02-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.521701,0.547351,0.008636,0.010927\" data-n=\"32\" title=\"ursino\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(32)</sup></button>，佢比起靜靜哋嘅<b>放紙鳶</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t02-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.403233,0.561921,0.009965,0.011921\" data-n=\"33\" title=\"kaito\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(33)</sup></button> 嘈好多，甚至比英國人嗰個<b>網球</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t02-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.309566,0.503642,0.010407,0.010927\" data-n=\"34\" title=\"teniso\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(34)</sup></button> 都嘈。","t02-29-1":"29. — 最後嗰項運動係啲大學生嘅樂趣。連我哋啲老師都好樂意去打。佢要好多技巧同敏捷，我好中意。至於<b>鞦韆</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t02-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.194641,0.469536,0.008636,0.010927\" data-n=\"35\" title=\"ocililo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(35)</sup></button> 嘅樂趣，我就留返畀啲女仔。","t02-30-1":"30. — 我唔中意英國人另一個遊戲，佢可能會變得危險。","t02-30-1b":"我想講嘅係<b>足球</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t02-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.454163,0.485762,0.009743,0.010596\" data-n=\"36\" title=\"ped-balono\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(36)</sup></button>，我大佬就好鍾意佢。我情願玩我哋舊時嗰個<b>奪旗戲</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t02-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.607396,0.478146,0.009743,0.010927\" data-n=\"38\" title=\"baro-ludo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(38)</sup></button>，一樣咁有益身體，而且真係冇咁粗野。","t02-tit-7":"<span class=\"pk\" data-korpo=\"10.2pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">單車同球類。</span>","t02-31-1":"31. — 我亦都好中意踩<b>單車</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t02-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.565766,0.54106,0.010629,0.010596\" data-n=\"37\" title=\"biciklo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(37)</sup></button> 圍住草地兜一個圈。","t02-32-1":"32. — 出年我會學<b>騎馬</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t02-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.694641,0.46755,0.008857,0.009272\" data-n=\"39\" title=\"kavalko\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(39)</sup></button>。一隻馬優雅咁行同小跑，又飛奔跳過障礙，幾咁靚呀！","t02-33-1":"33. — 夏天，我哋學<b>游水</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t02-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.820638,0.454967,0.010186,0.009603\" data-n=\"40\" title=\"natarto\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(40)</sup></button>。我哋好開心咁潛落河、喺清涼嘅河水入面浸。有時最後我哋會放一個紙<b>氣球</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t02-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.891497,0.325166,0.008857,0.010927\" data-n=\"41\" title=\"balono\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(41)</sup></button>，佢一裝滿熱氣就威威咁升上天。","t02-34-1":"34. — 仲有好多第啲遊戲，不過我數極都數唔完；睇完呢個簡略嘅講法，人人都明白，逢星期四喺我哋塊靚草地度，係唔會悶嘅。","t02-34-2":"附註。— <i>老師可以好容易咁將每一個最重要嘅遊戲講得再詳細啲，去補足呢一章。</i> <span class=\"fil\"></span>"},"noto":{"t01-noto-1":"(*) 講到<i>教名</i>，我哋勸大家連拉丁文嘅寫法都一齊抄低。咁做係避免無數異寫嘅唯一辦法。況且，<i>Giovanni、Jean、Johann、Jan、Hans、John、 Ivan</i>呢啲，點揀好呢？難道要為教名編一本專門嘅字典？我哋不如喺拉丁文攞佢哋嘅主格，就咁講：<b>Ioannes、Ioanna；Iulius、Iulia；Iakobus；Andreas； Lukas。</b>（完整文法）。","t02-noto-1":"(*) 細路哥嘅遊戲成日有純粹本國嘅名。我哋盡量用伊多語為佢哋改名，或者靠佢哋本身嘅動作，或者揀某國嘅名—— 只要嗰個名唔算太離譜。例如：<b>木桶戲</b>（德文同法文）就係<b>青蛙戲</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t02-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.58326,0.919868,0.010629,0.010596\" data-n=\"20\" title=\"ranoludo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(20)</sup></button>（英文），玩嘅人要將自己啲圓碟仔擲入嗰隻張大口企喺穿窿箱（木桶）上面嘅鐵青蛙個口度。<b>跳膊頭</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t02-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.59876,0.598344,0.009743,0.012583\" data-n=\"30\" title=\"shultro-salto\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(30)</sup></button> 同<b>跳山羊</b>唔同嘅地方只有一樣：要跳過個頭，玩嘅人要撐住同伴嘅膊頭，而喺「<b>跳山羊</b>」入面就只係撐住佢個背。— 又或者有幾個人彎低身，第啲人撐住佢哋膊頭跳過佢哋個背；前者要頂得住撞力唔可以塌低，後者要跳得過而唔失平衡（睇返呢張圖表）。"}}
